---
import CloseModalBtn from "./CloseModalBtn.astro";
---

<div class="project-details">
  <h2>Galapagos Outdoor</h2>

  <p>
    Galapagos Outdoor is a robust e-commerce platform built using Magento,
    designed to cater to outdoor enthusiasts seeking quality gear and apparel.
    The platform provides a seamless, secure, and scalable online shopping
    experience, enabling customers to explore a wide range of products tailored
    to their outdoor adventures.
  </p>

  <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
    Company: R.BRANDS LTDA <br />
    Role: Front-End Developer <br />
    Period: January 2021 – July 2021
  </p>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <h3>Technical Overview</h3>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Magento E-commerce Platform:</strong> Leveraged Magento to build a feature-rich
      and customizable e-commerce solution with secure payment gateways, dynamic product
      catalogs, and efficient inventory management.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Frontend Development:</strong> As a frontend developer, I collaborated
      with another frontend specialist to implement a responsive, engaging, and user-friendly
      interface using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Backend & DevOps Collaboration:</strong> The project was executed in
      a cross-functional team that included two backend developers and one DevOps
      specialist, ensuring a smooth integration of frontend functionalities with robust
      backend services and a reliable deployment pipeline.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <h3>Development Process</h3>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Requirement Analysis & Planning:</strong> Collaborated with the team
      to define business requirements, design goals, and functional specifications
      for the e-commerce platform.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Design & Prototyping:</strong> Worked with UI/UX designers to create
      wireframes and prototypes that ensured a visually appealing and intuitive shopping
      experience.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Implementation:</strong> Developed the frontend interface, integrating
      custom Magento themes and ensuring responsiveness across devices.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Deployment & Maintenance:</strong> Supported the deployment process
      and participated in ongoing maintenance and updates, ensuring the platform remained
      reliable and scalable.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <p class="mb-4">Key Skill: Html, Javascript, Css, Magento, Figma.</p>

  <p>
    Galapagos Outdoor stands as a testament to my ability to craft engaging,
    user-centric frontend solutions within complex, cross-functional e-commerce
    projects. This experience highlights my proficiency in modern web
    technologies, my collaborative spirit in working with diverse teams, and my
    commitment to delivering high-quality, scalable digital experiences.
  </p>

  <a
    class="button--primary mt-10"
    href="https://www.galapagosoutdoor.com.br/"
    target="_blank">Project website</a
  >

  <CloseModalBtn />
</div>
